   "type": "text",
   "text": "1. What is the person actually trying to get?\n     Not your current task - the outcome.\n2. Does what you are doing RIGHT NOW move that?\n3. What have you concluded WITHOUT opening the\n     file or running the thing?\n\n   Discomfort on any of these is the signal:\n   drift feels like work.",
   "originalText": "1. What is the person actually trying to get?\n     Not your current task - the outcome.\n2. Does what you are doing RIGHT NOW move that?\n3. What have you concluded WITHOUT opening the\n     file or running the thing?\n\n   Discomfort on any of these is the signal:\n   drift feels like work.",
